<Slide style={{ width:'1280px', height:'720px', padding:'60px', background:'#FFFFFF', fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei', display:'flex', flexDirection:'column' }}>
<Box style={{ height:46, flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', justifyContent:'space-between' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'baseline', gap:18 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>详细设计：业务模块</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 5.1–5.6、5.8–5.9 节</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', gap:12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>FTDMS · 总体设计报告</Text><Image src="assets/logo_icon.png" style={{ width: 36, height: 36, objectFit: 'contain' }} /></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:1, background:'#CFD9D2', marginTop:8, marginBottom:20 }}></Box>
<Box style={{ height:462, flexDirection:'column', gap:18 }}><Box style={{ height:240, flexDirection:'column', gap:0 }}><Box style={{ height:40, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>结构化</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>顺序 / 选择 / 循环三种基本结构，单入口单出口，避免深层嵌套</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:40, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>防御式校验</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>Controller 校验格式与区间，Service 校验业务，Repository 只做访问</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:40, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>事务边界</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>计划 + 明细、记录 + 组、授权变更同事务；模型调用不占数据库事务</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:40, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>幂等与一致</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>同日体重 upsert、重复授权幂等、删除不存在资源统一 1004</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:40, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>缺失不补零</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>null 与 0 语义分离；统计均值只除有效天数</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:40, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>可测试</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>关键算法抽为纯函数，外部模型可桩替换</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height:204, flexDirection:'row', gap:36 }}><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>账户、训练与饮食</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>注册不发令牌；登录签发 JWT（exp 7200 s）；登出写黑名单<br />计划与实际记录两条链路独立，终态不可回退<br />NutritionCalculator 纯函数；改克重按原快照比例换算</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>身体、统计、后台与前端</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>同日体重唯一 upsert；完成率分母剔除已取消计划<br />停用动作仅置 status，历史训练组仍可读<br />views 只依赖仓储接口；lib/http.js 统一检查 code 与 traceId</Text></Box></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:50, marginTop:9, background:'#F4F8F5', flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', padding:'0 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>详细设计不重复需求编号，只引用 FR 与接口编号，逐模块给出类、流程、算法与异常。</Text></Box>
</Slide>
